WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:04.793
Hello, everyone! I'm Ms. Emma. Welcome to Online B one, Book one.

2
00:00:05.093 --> 00:00:08.491
Hi! I'm Visal. Let's learn together!

3
00:00:08.791 --> 00:00:14.764
Unit twenty-four: Being Kind Online. Today you will give advice about being kind and safe online.

4
00:00:15.064 --> 00:00:17.670
Here is our lesson map. Let's start!

5
00:00:18.633 --> 00:00:21.704
Part one: words. You will learn eight new words.

6
00:00:22.550 --> 00:00:23.423
Online.

7
00:00:24.417 --> 00:00:26.265
Online means on the internet.

8
00:00:26.850 --> 00:00:28.884
I talk to my cousins online.

9
00:00:29.483 --> 00:00:31.915
Your turn. Say: Online.

10
00:00:34.767 --> 00:00:35.756
Online.

11
00:00:36.517 --> 00:00:37.367
Comment.

12
00:00:38.383 --> 00:00:40.789
Comment means a message you write under a post.

13
00:00:41.383 --> 00:00:42.988
She wrote a kind comment.

14
00:00:43.583 --> 00:00:46.305
Your turn. Say: Comment.

15
00:00:49.167 --> 00:00:49.970
Comment.

16
00:00:50.717 --> 00:00:51.416
Kind.

17
00:00:52.417 --> 00:00:54.289
Kind means friendly and caring.

18
00:00:54.883 --> 00:00:56.279
Be kind to everyone.

19
00:00:56.883 --> 00:00:59.257
Your turn. Say: Kind.

20
00:01:02.100 --> 00:01:02.892
Kind.

21
00:01:03.650 --> 00:01:04.489
Respect.

22
00:01:05.483 --> 00:01:09.306
Respect means treating people well and caring about their feelings.

23
00:01:09.917 --> 00:01:11.765
Show respect in group chats.

24
00:01:12.350 --> 00:01:14.968
Your turn. Say: Respect.

25
00:01:17.833 --> 00:01:18.858
Respect.

26
00:01:19.617 --> 00:01:20.478
Bully.

27
00:01:21.483 --> 00:01:24.388
Bully means to hurt or frighten someone again and again.

28
00:01:24.983 --> 00:01:26.994
Never bully anyone online.

29
00:01:27.583 --> 00:01:29.806
Your turn. Say: Bully.

30
00:01:32.667 --> 00:01:33.459
Bully.

31
00:01:34.217 --> 00:01:35.125
Share.

32
00:01:36.117 --> 00:01:38.987
Share means to post something so others can see it.

33
00:01:39.583 --> 00:01:41.606
Don't share photos without asking.

34
00:01:42.217 --> 00:01:44.625
Your turn. Say: Share.

35
00:01:47.467 --> 00:01:48.317
Share.

36
00:01:49.083 --> 00:01:49.725
Think.

37
00:01:50.717 --> 00:01:53.355
Think means to use your mind to consider something.

38
00:01:53.950 --> 00:01:55.346
Think before you post.

39
00:01:55.950 --> 00:01:58.498
Your turn. Say: Think.

40
00:02:01.333 --> 00:02:02.033
Think.

41
00:02:02.783 --> 00:02:03.541
Friend.

42
00:02:04.550 --> 00:02:06.851
Friend means a person you like and trust.

43
00:02:07.450 --> 00:02:09.415
Support a friend who is upset.

44
00:02:10.017 --> 00:02:12.506
Your turn. Say: Friend.

45
00:02:15.367 --> 00:02:16.286
Friend.

46
00:02:17.100 --> 00:02:20.635
Part two: dialogue. Let's listen to a conversation.

47
00:02:21.483 --> 00:02:24.156
Visal, how can we be kind online?

48
00:02:25.250 --> 00:02:28.796
Think before you post. Ask: is it kind?

49
00:02:29.883 --> 00:02:31.395
What if someone is bullied?

50
00:02:32.483 --> 00:02:36.215
Don't join in. Support your friend and tell an adult.

51
00:02:37.317 --> 00:02:38.712
Any more advice?

52
00:02:39.817 --> 00:02:44.861
Don't share other people's photos without asking. Be respectful!

53
00:02:46.000 --> 00:02:47.814
Part three: grammar.

54
00:02:48.650 --> 00:02:51.358
Grammar focus: Imperatives for advice.

55
00:02:51.658 --> 00:02:52.914
Look at the pattern.

56
00:02:53.617 --> 00:02:55.152
Think before you post.

57
00:02:56.050 --> 00:02:56.947
Be kind.

58
00:02:57.850 --> 00:02:59.826
Don't share photos without asking.

59
00:03:00.767 --> 00:03:05.044
Imperatives start with the base verb. Add 'Don't' for negative advice.

60
00:03:05.783 --> 00:03:09.515
Be careful! Don't say: Don't to post unkind comments.

61
00:03:11.467 --> 00:03:13.803
Say: Don't post unkind comments.

62
00:03:14.103 --> 00:03:18.204
Imperatives start with the base verb: Think, Be, Don't post.

63
00:03:19.000 --> 00:03:21.652
Part four: reading. Read and listen.

64
00:03:22.467 --> 00:03:24.350
Kindness on the Internet.

65
00:03:24.650 --> 00:03:27.102
Being kind online is very important.

66
00:03:28.100 --> 00:03:31.307
Before you share or post a comment, think: is it kind?

67
00:03:32.300 --> 00:03:34.613
Show respect, and never bully anyone.

68
00:03:35.600 --> 00:03:37.983
If you see unkind comments, don't join in.

69
00:03:38.967 --> 00:03:42.150
Support a friend who is upset, and tell an adult you trust.

70
00:03:43.267 --> 00:03:47.176
Part five: quiz. Three questions. Are you ready?

71
00:03:48.017 --> 00:03:49.587
blank before you post.

72
00:03:49.887 --> 00:03:53.145
A, Think. B, Thinking. C, To think.

73
00:03:56.700 --> 00:03:58.932
The answer is A: Think.

74
00:04:00.083 --> 00:04:02.745
A message you write under a post is a blank.

75
00:04:03.045 --> 00:04:06.617
A, comment. B, friend. C, share.

76
00:04:10.167 --> 00:04:11.864
The answer is A: comment.

77
00:04:13.017 --> 00:04:16.270
To hurt or frighten someone again and again is to blank.

78
00:04:16.570 --> 00:04:20.398
A, bully. B, respect. C, share.

79
00:04:23.933 --> 00:04:25.643
The answer is A: bully.

80
00:04:26.833 --> 00:04:30.089
Part six: speaking. It's your turn to talk.

81
00:04:30.950 --> 00:04:32.683
How can you be kind online?

82
00:04:41.483 --> 00:04:43.030
Now listen to Visal.

83
00:04:43.330 --> 00:04:51.741
Think before you post, and be kind in comments. Don't share photos without asking, and support friends who are sad.

84
00:04:52.041 --> 00:04:53.832
Excellent answer, Visal!

85
00:04:54.717 --> 00:04:59.122
Great work! Now you can use eight new words and imperatives for advice.

86
00:04:59.422 --> 00:05:02.701
Today's value is kindness. Be kind to everyone.

87
00:05:03.001 --> 00:05:05.793
See you in Unit twenty-five. Goodbye!

88
00:05:06.093 --> 00:05:08.734
Thank you, Ms. Emma! Bye, everyone!

